/P 41 0 R
/T (At Li Wah, they are not particularly concerned with accommodating Western culture and altering Chinese culture to better suit it. The atmosphere they intend to convey is one of heavy Chinese authenticity; The balance of the area lies in its ability to hold strongly to tradition and elicit a desire among people to eat comfortably in one place that puts the focus entirely on customers and almost no emphasis on profit. The service and attention to customers truly reflect this notion in real time.   )
