/T (The restaurant symbolizes the value of family in Chinese culture and has been passed down to the current owner, Ed Hom, from his late mother, Donna Hom, who came to Ohio in 1960 from Hong Kong.Founded in 1991 by Donna Hon and later managed by Ed Hom, Li Wah has become a significant part of AsiaTown and Cleveland. )
