/Title (Our project aims to discuss and analyze the cultural developments of Cleveland, Ohio, influenced by Chinese culture. Cleveland is home to many different nationalities after a large wave of immigration began in the early 1800s. Places like the Westside Market became places where food and people from around the world could interact and work. After some time in the city, small, neighborly sodalities formed. Eventually, the community of Asia town came to be.)
